{"title":"tax therapy t-rex microbook","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/tax-therapy-t-rex-microbook","date":1745051820000,"content":" \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c69c9a5a-f3d8-435d-a09a-6a49d274021f/tax+therapy1.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c69c9a5a-f3d8-435d-a09a-6a49d274021f/tax+therapy1.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c69c9a5a-f3d8-435d-a09a-6a49d274021f/tax+therapy1.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c69c9a5a-f3d8-435d-a09a-6a49d274021f/tax+therapy1.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c69c9a5a-f3d8-435d-a09a-6a49d274021f/tax+therapy1.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c69c9a5a-f3d8-435d-a09a-6a49d274021f/tax+therapy1.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c69c9a5a-f3d8-435d-a09a-6a49d274021f/tax+therapy1.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c69c9a5a-f3d8-435d-a09a-6a49d274021f/tax+therapy1.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n \n\n\n  <p><em>a microbook about the process and journey of doing my taxes</em></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n  <p>the reason why there is a T-Rex on the cover of this tax microbook is because after I spent all day Monday doing my taxes and other money-related organizational things (until 11PM), I watched Jurassic World with my partner until 1:15 AM (to devour the bureaucratic nonsense). </p><p>I woke up the next day with the beginnings of a headache, amazed at how easily wiped out I am by administrative tasks like these, and then spent most of Tuesday morning (April 15, tax day) horizontal on the couch, and half of the afternoon completing this microbook as my integration and recovery practice. I made most of this in parallel with doing my taxes (this is probably why I didn’t actually “start” taxes until 3 pm…). </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr /> \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a02c2426-b186-42f4-9913-91cea7dd1dfd/tax+therapy2.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"3658\" height=\"2744\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a02c2426-b186-42f4-9913-91cea7dd1dfd/tax+therapy2.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a02c2426-b186-42f4-9913-91cea7dd1dfd/tax+therapy2.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a02c2426-b186-42f4-9913-91cea7dd1dfd/tax+therapy2.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a02c2426-b186-42f4-9913-91cea7dd1dfd/tax+therapy2.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a02c2426-b186-42f4-9913-91cea7dd1dfd/tax+therapy2.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a02c2426-b186-42f4-9913-91cea7dd1dfd/tax+therapy2.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a02c2426-b186-42f4-9913-91cea7dd1dfd/tax+therapy2.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n <hr />\n\n\n  <p>I’ve been playing with the format of a single-page microbook/zine as a grounding container / creative accompaniment for me while I move through life. I think of it as a sort of creative mindfulness container/talisman, if you will, applicable to even the most dreaded bureaucratic tasks, like taxes.<br /><br />I started with a blank table of contents page, and wrote down my intentions: </p><p><em>“to transform something as anxiety-inducing/scarcity triggering/annoying as “filing my taxes” into an expression of my soveriegnty and creative, energetic, financial autonomy.”<br /><br /></em>I sensed into how my body was feeling about this, wrote an affirmation, and continued with tiptoeing into my process and arrival into the land of taxes and spreadsheets.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr /> \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/9db29e92-f6bb-431d-8075-5ed53dd70b6c/tax+therapy3.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"3683\" height=\"2762\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/9db29e92-f6bb-431d-8075-5ed53dd70b6c/tax+therapy3.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/9db29e92-f6bb-431d-8075-5ed53dd70b6c/tax+therapy3.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/9db29e92-f6bb-431d-8075-5ed53dd70b6c/tax+therapy3.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/9db29e92-f6bb-431d-8075-5ed53dd70b6c/tax+therapy3.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/9db29e92-f6bb-431d-8075-5ed53dd70b6c/tax+therapy3.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/9db29e92-f6bb-431d-8075-5ed53dd70b6c/tax+therapy3.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/9db29e92-f6bb-431d-8075-5ed53dd70b6c/tax+therapy3.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/44737367-2377-47bc-b3d2-afa95270e5ae/tax+therapy4.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"3770\" height=\"2828\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/44737367-2377-47bc-b3d2-afa95270e5ae/tax+therapy4.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/44737367-2377-47bc-b3d2-afa95270e5ae/tax+therapy4.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/44737367-2377-47bc-b3d2-afa95270e5ae/tax+therapy4.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/44737367-2377-47bc-b3d2-afa95270e5ae/tax+therapy4.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/44737367-2377-47bc-b3d2-afa95270e5ae/tax+therapy4.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/44737367-2377-47bc-b3d2-afa95270e5ae/tax+therapy4.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/44737367-2377-47bc-b3d2-afa95270e5ae/tax+therapy4.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n <hr />\n\n\n  <p>actually, in the process of working through my income and expenses spreadsheet and this microbook at the same time, I encountered multiple creative/idea breakthroughs that I will write about another day — </p><p>(1) money diaries as one way of storytelling for our embodied lives<br />(2) using comic sans + color to transform spreadsheets, and <br />(3) a transit metaphor for transforming how I relate to my financial infrastructure and life. </p><p>I was also surprised at how grateful I felt, looking at the different ways in which money flowed into my business and creative life this year — from unexpected donations to client projects to new courses. I felt the joy and satisfaction of self-employment. </p><p>but then… I realized that I was procrastinating on actually <em>doing</em> the taxes; that is, dealing with obfuscating IRS language and filing out forms. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr /> \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fbc62ff7-5116-4e15-85d5-86b2cf46c375/tax+therapy5.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fbc62ff7-5116-4e15-85d5-86b2cf46c375/tax+therapy5.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fbc62ff7-5116-4e15-85d5-86b2cf46c375/tax+therapy5.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fbc62ff7-5116-4e15-85d5-86b2cf46c375/tax+therapy5.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fbc62ff7-5116-4e15-85d5-86b2cf46c375/tax+therapy5.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fbc62ff7-5116-4e15-85d5-86b2cf46c375/tax+therapy5.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fbc62ff7-5116-4e15-85d5-86b2cf46c375/tax+therapy5.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fbc62ff7-5116-4e15-85d5-86b2cf46c375/tax+therapy5.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/f9578276-4bdd-4665-ad92-a6ac901322a3/tax+therapy6.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"3723\" height=\"2792\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/f9578276-4bdd-4665-ad92-a6ac901322a3/tax+therapy6.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/f9578276-4bdd-4665-ad92-a6ac901322a3/tax+therapy6.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/f9578276-4bdd-4665-ad92-a6ac901322a3/tax+therapy6.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/f9578276-4bdd-4665-ad92-a6ac901322a3/tax+therapy6.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/f9578276-4bdd-4665-ad92-a6ac901322a3/tax+therapy6.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/f9578276-4bdd-4665-ad92-a6ac901322a3/tax+therapy6.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/f9578276-4bdd-4665-ad92-a6ac901322a3/tax+therapy6.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n <hr />\n\n\n  <p>after doing that, I fell into a head loop — in which my meticulous nature felt weaponized against me. there was really banal, stupid things — like not being able to login to the IRS website, and being stuck refreshing again and again, or feeling completely overwhelmed by IRS language, like I was a creative alien encountering the “real world,” and seeing all the ways in which I didn’t fit in. </p><p>I did find some temporary relief through using a colorful 1040 google spreadsheet I made myself last year — calculating all the numbers myself (double checking with the software) — gave me a feeling of autonomy and agency that felt really important to me. </p><p>but, by the time I escaped the glitching loop hole, paid all my owed taxes and my estimated taxes, it was 11PM and I was frustrated and stressed and just wanted to fill my head with something else. <br /><br /><strong>enter:</strong> the T-REX. <br /><br />*</p><p>my fatal flaw is that I am really not someone who can just roll up her sleeves and “get things done” if not <em>all</em> of me wants to do it — whether from true creative desire, or simply to relieve myself from suffocating pressure and guilt. </p><p>I seem to have two binary modes — totally disembodied and disconnected (which is how I paid my estimated taxes), or really diving in and getting stuck in the misery administrative swamp, and learning something new and transformative about myself in the process (which is how I do taxes). </p><p>this year, I do intend to work on installing a third mode <em>(can I do this with reoccuring lightness? less procrastination? simplicity and ease?)</em> I’m curious as to what systems can help me approach this work gently, preferably more than once a year. </p><p>by the end of making this microbook, I’ve decided that the Tyrannosaurus Rex would be my spirit animal — to help me crush all bureaucratic nonsense in between her powerful jaws. so, that’s why, on Tuesday afternoon, I drew her on the cover. we existed in the land before time, and even though we may be extinct now, our power is still more viscerally real than any of this. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr /> \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/738f5d43-4e55-4a95-8ebd-595f741bb482/IMG_3989.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"3500\" height=\"2752\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/738f5d43-4e55-4a95-8ebd-595f741bb482/IMG_3989.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/738f5d43-4e55-4a95-8ebd-595f741bb482/IMG_3989.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/738f5d43-4e55-4a95-8ebd-595f741bb482/IMG_3989.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/738f5d43-4e55-4a95-8ebd-595f741bb482/IMG_3989.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/738f5d43-4e55-4a95-8ebd-595f741bb482/IMG_3989.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/738f5d43-4e55-4a95-8ebd-595f741bb482/IMG_3989.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/738f5d43-4e55-4a95-8ebd-595f741bb482/IMG_3989.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n  <p><strong>more on this:</strong> </p><p><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/overcoming-my-fear-of-taxes-a-comic\" target=\"_blank\">overcoming my fear of taxes: a comic</a><br /><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/money-as-a-circle\" target=\"_blank\">money as a circle</a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n ","author":"Kening Zhu","siteTitle":"kening zhu","siteHash":"ef8a94b9fc20c32a4ee7d94ee971337d278e8b2fafe747123e4eb5cea026e84e","entryHash":"43704198a53cfc90e5d955a1bed3fbf0618f8df8bf709b82d696411209c3cfba","category":"Sites"}